/*
  ResetSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0212 · ResetSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ResetSection` resolves (table "ResetSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/ResetSection.tsx + the ConfirmDialog it mounts and the
  useSettingsReset error toasts). The trailing group backs the native-only chrome the
  Apple HIG states contract requires (section-list status banner, loading + empty copy,
  toast affordances, accessibility).
*/

/* --- Panel header (web source, parity) --- */
